ver:text-black dark:hover:text-white rounded-sm" href="/docs/community/community-intro">Community</a><span>/</span><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white rounded-sm" href="/guides">Guides</a></div><article><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-col sm:items-stretch sm:gap-4"><div class="max-w-xl 2xl:max-w-[520px]"><h1 class="text-[36px] leading-tight font-medium tracking-tighter text-balance md:text-[28px]">Building Real-Time Comments with a Serverless Postgres</h1><p class="mt-[1.125rem] text-xl leading-tight tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-40 dark:text-gray-new-70 md:mt-1.5 md:text-lg">A guide to building your own real-time comments in a Next.js application with Ably LiveSync and Postgres.</p></div><div class="relative mt-2.5 w-fit sm:mt-0"><div class="flex items-center border border-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20"><button class="flex h-8 w-fit shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border-r border-gray-new-90 px-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-black-new hover:bg-gray-new-98 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-94 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="size-4 shrink-0"><g clip-path="url(#copy-docs_inline_svg__a)"><mask id="copy-docs_inline_svg__b" width="16" height="16" x="0" y="0" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" style="mask-type:luminance"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 0h16v16H0z"></path></mask><g stroke="currentColor" mask="url(#copy-docs_inline_svg__b)"><path d="M5.947 14.63h8.683V5.945H5.947z"></path><path d="M3.579 10.684H2V2h8.683v1.579"></path></g></g><defs><clipPath id="copy-docs_inline_svg__a"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 0h16v16H0z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><span class="text-sm leading-none tracking-extra-tight whitespace-nowrap">Copy page</span></button><button class="flex h-8 items-center px-1 hover:bg-gray-new-98 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 15" class="size-3.5 text-gray-new-50 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-new-50"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.5 5.75 7 9.25l3.5-3.5"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="prose-doc post-content prose dark:prose-invert xs:prose-code:break-words mt-10 lg:mt-7 md:mt-5"><p>Can a serverless Postgres database really handle the demands of a real-time application? The answer lies in pairing it with the right publish-subscribe model. In this guide, you will learn how to combine the real-time capabilities of Ably LiveSync with the structured power of Neon Postgres to build a optimistic and scalable comment system in your Next.js application.</p>
<h2 id="prerequisites" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Prerequisites</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#prerequisites" aria-label="Link to Prerequisites"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>To follow this guide, you’ll need the following:</p>
<ul>
<li><a class="group inline" href="https://nodejs.org/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Node.js 18<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> or later</li>
<li>A <a class="group inline" href="https://console.neon.tech/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Neon<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> account</li>
<li>An <a class="group inline" href="https://ably.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ably<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> account</li>
<li>A <a class="group inline" href="https://vercel.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> account</li>
</ul>
